 "text": "Hey, nice to hear from you. How are you? A balanced meal is key. Try something she likes at every meal, so she gets mixed flavours. Lots of brown bread, rice, noodles, baked beans, oats, pasta. Yellow doesn't mean terrible, it' just one colour. Oats, toast, fruit and milk. If she likes it, that's fine. If she's open, try a smoothie with milk, fruit and a little honey. Giving her small job makes it feel like her meal, and she' learn along the way.",
